    <string name="settings_community_standards_title">Milawu ya vaaki</string>
    <string name="settings_community_standards_body">StudySync i ya ku dyondza na ku tirha swin’we. U nga avelani, u nga kombeli, kumbe u lava swifaniso kumbe video ya masangu eka mahungu, tifayili, tikholo ta video, kumbe phurofayili ya wena. Hi nga susa swilo na ku yimisa tiakhawunti leti tlulaka milawu leyi.</string>
    <string name="classes_hero_subtitle">Hlela tinhlengeletano, nghena live, u hlayisa tinoutse na switirhisiwa eka ndhawu yin’we.</string>
    <string name="classes_hint_has_items">Pfulela kilasi ku vona vuxokoxoko, video ya live, na tifayili leti aveleriweke. U nga yi cinca eka xikirini xa vuxokoxoko.</string>
    <string name="classes_hint_empty">Tumbuluxa kilasi hi + ku engetela tinhlengeletano, swihlanganisi, na tidokhumente.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_empty_activity">A ku na ntirho wa sweswi. Pfulela ntlawa ku avelana tifayili na ku vulavula, kumbe sungula kilasi ya tinhlengeletano ta live.</string>
    <string name="chats_hero_subtitle">Rhumela mahungu eka mintlawa ya wena u landzelela swihundzuluxo leswi aveleriweke.</string>
    <string name="groups_hero_title">Mintlawa</string>
    <string name="groups_hero_subtitle">Tumbuluxa ndhawu yo vulavula na ku avelana tidokhumente — kutani u pfulela Mahungu ku vulavula.</string>
    <string name="groups_dialog_new_title">Ntlawa lowuntshwa</string>
    <string name="groups_empty_hint">A ku na mintlawa. Tsindzela + ku tumbuluxa ndhawu ya tifayili na mbulavulo.</string>
